<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers upgraded its rating for Centocor Inc Wednesday to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The firm set a target price on the stock of $45.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Malvern, Pa., biotechnology company were up 1-3/8 to 28-1/4 in late morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
